# (docs/checklists/review-calibration.md stays public: it is a shipped method.)
#
# NOTE: docs/evals/ is intentionally NOT gitignored. Eval records are the gate's
# source of truth (spec-gate / merge-gate read COMMITTED records) and the basis of
# compounding (regression baselines, /improve calibration), so they must be
# committed. They are kept out of the PUBLIC repo by the clean-snapshot-at-publish
# step + an enforced pre-push guard (see the internal-path denylist), NOT by
# gitignore.
